# Keep line endings LF everywhere, including in the working tree on Windows.
# Without this, Git checks files out as CRLF and Prettier's endOfLine: "lf"
# reports every file as unformatted, so `npm run format:check` fails locally
# while passing in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
